      "title": {
        "en": "Supportive and attentive veterinary clinicians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners express deep appreciation for the veterinary team, noting doctors such as Dr. Latos, Dr. Rogel, and Dr. Nardi for their compassionate, unhurried care and clear explanations. Staff members are described as welcoming and willing to accommodate urgent situations. A couple of reviewers felt dissatisfied when treatment requests or phone calls did not align with expectations."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Helpful phone support and guidance"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients emphasize clear, transparent communication from both receptionists and veterinarians throughout the care process. Reviewers cite helpful phone assistance when scheduling or requesting international health documentation, as well as prompt follow-ups during critical emergencies. One owner noted frustration when unable to speak directly with the treating doctor over medication refills."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Prompt treatment and emergency interventions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Several reviewers highlight life-saving medical care and successful treatment outcomes, including urgent surgical interventions following predator attacks and effective pain relief for severe spinal distress. Owners of chronically ill pets value the steady health management provided. A dissenting review reported paying for diagnostic tests without obtaining requested prescription refills."
      }
    }
  ],
